# App Router

- Server Components by default; `'use client'` only for interactivity.
- Never write cookies during render — use `proxy.ts`, route handlers, or
  server actions.
- `next/image` without `priority` except the true above-the-fold hero;
  grids/lists never use `priority`. Remote hosts: `cdn.shopify.com`,
  `res.cloudinary.com`.
- Respect `cacheComponents: true`: keep prerendered routes static-safe,
  session logic at request boundaries.
